{"task_id": "2d5acf84dd20", "source": "bank:f2c80d62966a", "bank": "f2c80d62966a", "original_id": "H29", "title": "Depth-Colored Nested Frames", "difficulty": "hard", "skills": ["nested containment", "ordering", "recoloring"], "written_solution": "The input consists of nested rectangular frames. Recolor the outermost frame to red(2), the next nested frame to green(3), the next to yellow(4), and so on in depth order, preserving the frame shapes.", "train": [{"input": ["000000000", "011111110", "010000010", "010111010", "010101010", "010111010", "010000010", "011111110", "000000000"], "output": ["000000000", "022222220", "020000020", "020333020", "020303020", "020333020", "020000020", "022222220", "000000000"]}, {"input": ["00000000000", "01111111110", "01000000010", "01011111010", "01010001010", "01010101010", "01010001010", "01011111010", "01000000010", "01111111110", "00000000000"], "output": ["00000000000", "02222222220", "02000000020", "02033333020", "02030003020", "02030403020", "02030003020", "02033333020", "02000000020", "02222222220", "00000000000"]}, {"input": ["000000000000", "011111111110", "010000000010", "010111111010", "010100001010", "010100001010", "010111111010", "010000000010", "011111111110", "000000000000"], "output": ["000000000000", "022222222220", "020000000020", "020333333020", "020300003020", "020300003020", "020333333020", "020000000020", "022222222220", "000000000000"]}, {"input": ["0000000000000", "0111111111110", "0100000000010", "0101111111010", "0101000001010", "0101011101010", "0101010101010", "0101011101010", "0101000001010", "0101111111010", "0100000000010", "0111111111110", "0000000000000"], "output": ["0000000000000", "0222222222220", "0200000000020", "0203333333020", "0203000003020", "0203044403020", "0203040403020", "0203044403020", "0203000003020", "0203333333020", "0200000000020", "0222222222220", "0000000000000"]}], "test": {"input": ["000000000000", "011111111110", "010000000010", "010111111010", "010100001010", "010101101010", "010101101010", "010100001010", "010111111010", "010000000010", "011111111110", "000000000000"], "output": ["000000000000", "022222222220", "020000000020", "020333333020", "020300003020", "020304403020", "020304403020", "020300003020", "020333333020", "020000000020", "022222222220", "000000000000"]}, "program_solution": "(rule!\n  (let* ((mask (grid-from-fn (rows g) (cols g)\n                 (lambda (r c) (if (= (at g r c) 0) 0 1))))\n         (objs (sort (objects mask 0)\n                     (lambda (a b)\n                       (> (* (obj-h a) (obj-w a)) (* (obj-h b) (obj-w b)))))))\n    (for/fold ([out (empty-grid (rows g) (cols g) 0)])\n              ([obj (in-list objs)]\n               [i (in-naturals 2)])\n      (paint-cells out (obj-cells obj) i))))", "solution_language": "racket", "needs_conversion": false, "content_hash": "2d5acf84dd20", "slug": "depth_colored_nested_frames", "parent_hash": null, "parent_reason": null}
